{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"1":{"eng-name":"Purification (Kitab Al-Taharah)","ara-name":"كتاب الطهارة"}},"section_detail":{"1":{"hadithnumber_first":1,"hadithnumber_last":390,"arabicnumber_first":1,"arabicnumber_last":390}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":146,"arabicnumber":146,"text":"Rapporté par Thawban رضي الله عنه : Le Messager d’Allah ﷺ a envoyé une expédition. Ils ont souffert du froid. À leur retour, il leur a ordonné d’essuyer par-dessus leurs turbans et leurs chaussettes","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":1,"hadith":146},"chapter":{"id":57,"ara-name":"باب الْمَسْحِ عَلَى الْعِمَامَةِ","eng-name":"Wiping Over the 'Imamah (Turban)","isFirstHadith":true}}]}